      "content": "those jokes don't really work for a roast set lol they're kinda too random and don't actually hit on the cultural stuff im looking for. a roast needs to be more specific to the vibe of the groups. like, can u try again but actually focus on the social differences? maybe like how different groups handle loud music at a party, or how they approach personal space/crowds. just make them observational and sharp.",
